flowchart LR
  C[Fresh console output] --> X[Evidence reconciliation]
  G[Stored known-good configuration] --> X
  F[Main and West FortiGate SNMP<br/>health, IF-MIB ports, Phase 2 tunnels] --> N[NOC Telegraf on 10.0.0.22]
  FC[FortiGate configured<br/>VLAN subinterfaces] --> N
  N --> Q[(InfluxDB)]
  Q --> QT[Keep string and numeric<br/>Flux field tables separate]
  Q --> VS[Newest FortiGate VLAN table timestamp<br/>shared by rows and success marker]
  QT --> RATE[Two monotonic 64-bit octet samples<br/>aligned to current interface timestamp]
  RATE --> T[Authenticated device telemetry API<br/>measured bps and utilization]
  VS --> T
  T --> P[Firewall Port Map]
  T --> V2[VPN tunnel status]
  T --> FR[Fred bounded evidence tools]
  P --> M
  V2 --> M
  FR --> M
  M{Metric observed in current source?}
  M -->|Yes| V[Expose exact measured value]
  M -->|No| B[Return blank / not collected]
  V --> X
  B --> X
  X --> L[Local access port and VLAN]
  L --> U[Local uplink and LAG]
  U --> R[Reciprocal upstream port]
  R --> D[Downstream dependencies]
  D --> I[Independent service signal]
  I --> O[Fault domain and confidence]
  O --> A[Test, fix, validation, rollback]
